<PolicyPage title="Refund & Cancellation Policy" description="Cancellations, returns and refunds for Jhumka orders, including damaged or wrong items.">
  <p>We want you to be happy with your piece. If something is wrong, tell us quickly and we will put it right.</p>

  <h2>Cancelling an order</h2>
  <p>You can cancel an order before it is dispatched by calling or messaging us with your order number. Once a parcel has been handed to the courier, it can no longer be cancelled.</p>

  <h2>Damaged, faulty or wrong item</h2>
  <p>If your piece arrives damaged, faulty, or is not what you ordered, contact us within <span class="todo">[TO CONFIRM: 48 hours / 7 days]</span> of delivery with:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>your order number,</li>
    <li>photographs of the piece and the packaging, and</li>
    <li>an unboxing video, if you have one (it helps us with courier claims).</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We will arrange a replacement or a full refund, including any shipping you paid.</p>

  <h2>Change of mind</h2>
  <p><span class="todo">[TO CONFIRM: do you accept returns if the customer simply changes their mind? If yes, state the window (e.g. 7 days), the condition the piece must be in (unworn, with tags and packaging), and who pays return shipping. If no, say so plainly here.]</span></p>

  <h2>Items we cannot take back</h2>
  <p>For hygiene reasons, earrings cannot be returned once worn, unless they arrived damaged or faulty. Pieces that have been altered, resized or damaged after delivery cannot be returned.</p>

  <h2>How refunds are paid</h2>
  <p>Approved refunds go back to the original payment method through Razorpay. Banks usually credit the money within <span class="todo">[TO CONFIRM: 5–7 business days]</span> of us processing it. We will confirm by phone or email once the refund is on its way.</p>

  <h2>Talk to us first</h2>
  <p>Most problems are quicker to solve over a call. Contact details are below, and your order page shows everything we know about your order.</p>
</PolicyPage>
